        <section id="limits">
          <h2>6. Honest limitations &amp; verification status (228 tests)</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Verified today (228 passing Rust unit tests: 17 core + 211 runtime):</strong> <code>claude_pre_tool_hook_rewrites_safe_commands_and_preserves_input_fields</code>, <code>cli_shim_path_resolution_skips_shim_dir_to_prevent_recursion</code>, <code>compacts_verbose_human_git_status</code>, <code>append_and_load_jsonl_handles_atomic_writes_and_recovers_concatenated_lines</code>, and <code>summarizes_token_savings_by_source</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Open limitations stated plainly:</strong> (1) native <code>read_file</code> in AGY/Codex/OpenCode is not automatically intercepted by MCP dedup yet; (2) <code>compact_context</code> (<code>260k</code> token ceiling) does not emit <code>TokenSaving</code> telemetry yet; (3) aggregate weekly turn-level reduction remains <code>[TBD: 3–7 day / ≥50-turn sample post-c83e5c7]</code>; and (4) Cockpit remains a pre-beta orchestrator without an inline code editor, signed installer, or plugin marketplace.</li>
          </ul>
